SUMMARY:Live Band Karaoke (ft. The Blind Tigers) @ Rubies on Five Points
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\n***NOT FREE-$5 COVER AT THE DOOR***\
 n\nIt's about time we absolutely tear it up again. This is always such a g
 ood time. I figure we have ourselves an outing and if we decide the night 
 should continue elsewhere then may the night lead us on. Here's the websit
 e description:\n\nThink you’ve got karaoke game? Swagger like Mick Jagge
 r swagger? Slay like Beyonce?\nWell ditch that old digital canned karaoke 
 music\, cuz it's time to level up and be the lead singer in a live band! D
 urham’s only live karaoke band\, Blind Tigers\, will be your backing ban
 d. And yeah\, they’re as good as you’ve heard. They know a ton of song
 s\, ranging from 70s classics to today’s hits. Get on stage\, wait for t
 he downbeat and prepare to crush it in front of screaming fans. This is yo
 ur moment. You are such a rock star.
