SUMMARY:Bull City: Walk & Brew 🍻 
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nBull City Walk & Brew: Old Durham\, 
 Brightleaf & 9th Street 🍻☕🌮\n\nThis round of Walk & Brew takes us 
 through Old Durham\, Brightleaf Square\, and 9th Street for a fun social s
 troll with a few great local stops along the way.\n\nWe’ll meet outside 
 Whole Foods (please do not park in their lot — use free side-street park
 ing nearby)\, then head to Cocoa Cinnamon\, make our way down to Brightlea
 f Square and Devine’s\, and finish up on 9th Street at Cosmic Cantina.\n
 \nIt’s part walk\, part drinks\, part exploring Durham\, and part just b
 eing outside with cool people. Come sip\, stroll\, and cap it off with tac
 os.🌮\n\nRescheduled to June 13th
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31508
 0850/
