SUMMARY:Bull City: Walk & Brew 🍻  (HotDog Edition 🌭)
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nAnother Bull City Walk & Brew is her
 e 🍻\n\nWe’ll meet outside Boxcar Bar + Arcade at 1 PM for our usual r
 oughly 3-mile downtown walk.\n\nRoute:\nMeet outside Boxcar → The Can Op
 ener (1st stop) → American Tobacco Campus → Velvet Hippo (2nd stop) 
 → Motorco / Parts & Labor (last stop)\n\nWe’ll wrap up around 4 PM at 
 Motorco’s Parts & Labor for the 3rd Annual Wienerfest 🌭\n\nSo if you 
 enjoy walking\, drinks\, rooftops\, hot dogs\, and pretending your life is
  beautifully curated — this one’s for you.\n\nCome walk\, have a drink
 \, see downtown\, and pretend we’re the kind of people who do wholesome 
 social activities. (There’s free street parking downtown on the weekends
  too!)
